ind":"announcement","title":"Deep Frost 1.2.2","summary":"Fixed a notification that could remain in the previous language after switching languages, including Korean.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044636","verified_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114044516","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Would you have burned IRIS?","summary":"The station voted. IRIS gave last words. Would you have burned IRIS? Free demo: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4691610/ Deep Frost launches tomorrow, October 27 at 10:00 ET. #DemoMonday","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:04:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044516","verified_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114042571","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Two lines, one liar","summary":"GAREN: \"I never left the MESS HALL.\" Mess hall camera: GAREN not in the mess hall, 05:40 to 05:45. Is Garen lying, or is the camera wrong? In Deep Frost, a contradiction is a lead, not proof. Free demo: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4691610/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042571","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:32:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114042397","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"update","title":"Deep Frost: update notes","summary":"This update focuses on clearer text, steadier controls and save continuity. Added an optional call-sign prompt for your first new run. Daily opinion-question limits now persist when saving and continuing. Continuing a mid-day save also preserves pending oxygen-loss effects until their overnight resolution. Reduced repeated rendering when revisiting unchanged ARCHIVE pages. Title-menu input waits for the opening reveal to finish. Inactive controller noise no longer switches the active input devic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T17:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042397","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:32:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114040326","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Who was waiting at the lab door when your demo ended?","summary":"The demo ends at dawn on Day 4. Someone is waiting at the lab door, and the blood test is about to start. Who was standing there in your run? And did you trust the right people? Tell us who you trusted and why. The full game picks up at the blood test on October 27. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46120211/743ba1dc890635090b7be1a1699a68439347eb6a.png","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T18:01:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040326","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:37:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114039569","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Frost 1.2: clearer first hour, controller and translation fixes","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo and told us where the first hour gets confusing. Patch 1.2 is about making the station easier to read without changing how the game plays. New help for your first hour Short explainers now appear the first time you meet rapport, a leaked private word, a rumor, and ash colours. Each is one or two plain sentences. A new FIRST-HOUR TIPS page, reachable from the title screen (next to HOW TO PLAY) and from the pause menu: seven tips on questioning, records an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039569","verified_at":"2026-10-24T17:17:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114037013","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Four days to launch: first-hour fixes going into the release build","summary":"Deep Frost releases on Steam for Windows on Tuesday, October 27, 2026 at 10:00 ET, four days from now. It is a single-player social-deduction horror game set in a failing Antarctic research station. This week, first-time playtesters played through the opening of the game, and we reviewed the first hour with them in mind. A few spots were easy to get stuck on or hard to read. The launch build is getting fixes for them: - Clearer guidance when a hint points you to someone. - Cleaner text in Simpli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:05:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037013","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:00:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1847286114032552","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest dev note: how a vote works in Deep Frost","summary":"Halfway through Steam Next Fest, here's a quick guide to the most important moment in Deep Frost: the vote. - Day 1 is a practice ballot. You name a suspect, but nobody is purged. - From Day 2, the crew votes for real. Each vote counts 1, the captain's vote counts 2, and a blank ballot counts 0. - If two or more people tie for the most votes, the crew holds a runoff between just them. - Before you vote, compare what people told you with the records: cameras, badge logs and station systems. A con","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032552","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:08:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1846651706692637","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Frost launches October 27","summary":"Deep Frost, a single-player social-deduction horror game, launches on Steam on October 27. Twelve researchers are trapped at a failing Antarctic station, and something among them is not who it claims to be. Question the crew, compare what they tell you with camera, badge and station records, keep notes, and decide who to trust before each vote. A contradiction is a lead, not proof. The full game includes: - Nine days, with Crew and Thaw roles - Station emergencies, blood testing and a captain el","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1846651706692430","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Pre-recorded gameplay: try the free Deep Frost demo","summary":"Watch a pre-recorded gameplay replay of Deep Frost. Play the free Windows demo on our Steam page. Follow and wishlist to get the launch in your Steam calendar.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:25:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1846651706691325","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Frost is in Steam Next Fest: play the free demo","summary":"Deep Frost is a single-player social-deduction horror game set in a failing Antarctic research station. A parasitic intelligence called the Thaw is copying the crew, and the crew votes on who to purge. The free demo is part of Steam Next Fest, from October 19 to October 26. It covers Days 1 to 3 and ends after Night 3. In the demo you play as Crew. Question the crew, check station records and compare accounts in the Case File. A contradiction gives you a lead; it does not prove anyone is infecte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1846651706684494","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"update","title":"Deep Frost update: clearer clues and smoother play before Next Fest","summary":"A new update is live for the free demo and the full game (launching October 27). Thank you to everyone who played and sent feedback. Clearer investigation Night alibis now line up with the incidents they describe, so the contradictions you find are the real ones. Early guidance points you to crew you have not talked to yet, and no longer presents yesterday's incidents as fresh leads. When two accounts cannot be resolved, the Case File now says why: they are about different people, or the times d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:46:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1846651706681308","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"update","title":"What's new in the latest update before launch","summary":"This update changes the free demo. The full game launches on October 27, 2026 with the same changes, apart from those to the demo ending. The first day The first time you open a conversation with a crewmate in a run, they open with their own signature line, a short line that is theirs alone. If a record about someone else is pinned at that moment, the line comes later. On the guided first day, at the step where you compare a person's account with your records, SHOW is now the selected button whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:35:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4675840-1837955055364146","game_id":"steam-4675840","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Frost is in Steam Social Deduction Fest","summary":"Twelve researchers. Nine days. Something is wearing their faces. Deep Frost is part of Steam Social Deduction Fest, running July 13-16. Deep Frost is a singleplayer social-deduction horror roguelike set at a failing Antarctic research station. Read alibis, strange votes, private whispers, planted clues, and who benefits when the station starts falling apart. The free demo covers Days 1-3. Meet the crew, hear MOIRA, survive station operations, and start working out who is still human before the f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T18:20:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}]